Z||000000||sqoach||08-08-2001||12:57 AM||||Me and my family are flying to California on Thursday for our yearly vacation. First we'll be in L.A., then we're heading up to San Francisco, then back to L.A. I would like to meet some of you that live that way, but we'll be pretty busy. And nobody in my family is crazy about fieros, except me of course  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> We're thinking about going to a car show in/near Fremont. I think it's a classic car show. Are fieros considered classic cars?<BR>Anyway, I guess this isn't really fiero-related, but I wanted to make sure everyone knew where I was in case they needed to contact me. Or if I don't answer e-mails, this will be the reason. I don't think I'll have access to the net. Be back in a week!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||6
