Z||000005||sqoach||08-08-2001||01:16 PM||||Fieroshop, I think we are driving through Richmond, so I should be able to stop by. Is the shop pretty easy to find?<P>I think we're planning on driving down a lot of the coast line. Just taking a cruise and seeing the sights.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>DAD, the car show is in Fremont. I'm not exactly sure where in Fremont, but shouldn't be hard to find. It's on the 11th (Saturday) and lasts from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m. I believe.||||reg||10
